exists su say be default ob name say ya
su name loop be refinery def
su name listen from filename "artifacts/hear/talk-loop-input.wav" be hear do
su name draft from ve name listen ob text "Reply in one short sentence." for name mind to name text mind-out be write do
su name speak from ve name draft ob name mind-out be say vyah stream do
su name stop from ve name speak ob name voice vyah cancel be say do
prah
